$ nexoctl mb --with-images mem/pictures
Bucket created successfully `mem/pictures`, with image variants (media rule "images": every format at every width).

$ nexoctl mb --with-hls --with-images mem/library
Bucket created successfully `mem/library`, with HLS video (media rule "hls": every rendition, a poster and thumbnails), with image variants (media rule "images": every format at every width).

$ nexoctl mb --ignore-existing --with-images --json mem/library
{"status":"success","target":"mem/library","bucket":"library","images":true}

$ nexoctl media get mem/library
